          "message": {
            "text": "CDP content quads are the authoritative SVG-capable activation fact. Per-capture live object registries avoid marker attributes and appended HTML children, so author selectors and SVG layout stay untouched; a missing quad for a paint-bearing transformed plane fails closed to the Chromium surface boundary. Pinned Blink paintpropertytree_builder.cc lines 1161-1252 and 1330-1490 establish the SVG-child-affine versus layout-box-4x4 split, and the 19-row live audit proves inert SVG perspective remains vector while root and foreignObject projective paint choose one reachable owner.",
            "markdown": "CDP content quads are the authoritative SVG-capable activation fact. Per-capture live object registries avoid marker attributes and appended HTML children, so author selectors and SVG layout stay untouched; a missing quad for a paint-bearing transformed plane fails closed to the Chromium surface boundary. Pinned Blink paint_property_tree_builder.cc lines 1161-1252 and 1330-1490 establish the SVG-child-affine versus layout-box-4x4 split, and the 19-row live audit proves inert SVG perspective remains vector while root and foreignObject projective paint choose one reachable owner."
