            "text": "Strict frame seeking happens before external-reference, font, image, control, scrollbar, projective, pseudo, text, and raster prepasses. The resulting same-frame record carries the independently measured CDP quads, computed composition, residual, and effective outer raster owner; static callers pay no computed-frame payload cost.",
            "markdown": "Strict frame seeking happens before external-reference, font, image, control, scrollbar, projective, pseudo, text, and raster prepasses. The resulting same-frame record carries the independently measured CDP quads, computed composition, residual, and effective outer raster owner; static callers pay no computed-frame payload cost."
          },
          "locations": [
