          "message": {
            "text": "Every asynchronous capture prepass is separated by an exact timeline revalidation. Re-running the hold protocol and comparing its serialized source/target/range facts catches scroll, subject, TreeScope, or target churn instead of assuming one early pause remains authoritative.",
            "markdown": "Every asynchronous capture prepass is separated by an exact timeline revalidation. Re-running the hold protocol and comparing its serialized source/target/range facts catches scroll, subject, TreeScope, or target churn instead of assuming one early pause remains authoritative."
